<title>BELGIUM: EU exporters bid for extra German intvn rye.</title>
<headline>EU exporters bid for extra German intvn rye.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders, who bid on Thursday for the export of 101,800 tonnes of German intervention rye, were seeking just over half the extra 200,000 tonnes made available in an EU tender.</p>
<p>EU Official Journal L 87/1, published on Tuesday, said that the tender had been increased to 800,005 tonnes, from 600,005 tonnes, with immediate effect. rtr phb</p>
</text>
